Package: meadow
Architecture: all
Depends: meadow-shell (>= ${source:Version}), sddm-theme-meadow (= ${source:Version}),
 meadow-themes (= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: classic Luna-style Wayland desktop (metapackage)
 Meadow recreates the look and feel of a classic early-2000s "Luna" desktop
 with entirely original artwork: a taskbar with a green start button, a
 two-column Start menu, an SDDM Welcome screen, labwc window decorations and
 matching GTK, Qt, icon, cursor and sound themes.
 .
 Installing it does not change the display manager or PAM; meadow-setup
 does that on request.

Package: meadow-common
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window, qt6-svg-plugins
Description: shared library and Luna QML controls for Meadow
 The Meadow theme loader, sound player and the Meadow.Controls and
 Meadow.Welcome QML modules, shared by the Meadow shell and SDDM theme.

Package: meadow-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, meadow-common (= ${binary:Version}),
 meadow-themes (= ${source:Version}), labwc (>= 0.9), qt6-wayland, libpam-runtime, polkitd,
 systemd, xwayland, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, pipewire, wireplumber,
 network-manager, upower, xdg-utils, pcmanfm-qt, qt6-style-kvantum, python3
Recommends: grim, network-manager-gnome
Suggests: system-config-printer, yelp, qt6ct, pamtester
Description: Meadow desktop shell, session files and setup tool
 meadow-shell draws the taskbar, Start menu, notification area, desktop and
 system dialogs as layer-shell surfaces on labwc. Also contains the Meadow
 Wayland session entry, the lock screen's PAM service (password only) and the
 opt-in meadow-setup system configuration tool.

Package: sddm-theme-meadow
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sddm, qml6-module-qtquick, meadow-common (>= ${source:Version}),
 meadow-themes (= ${source:Version})
Recommends: fprintd, libpam-fprintd, qml6-module-qtquick-virtualkeyboard
Description: Meadow Welcome screen theme for SDDM
 A Luna-style Welcome screen for SDDM with user tiles, session and keyboard
 layout switchers, fingerprint support and a Turn Off Computer dialog.
 Installing it does not make it the active theme; see meadow-setup.

Package: meadow-themes
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Description: Meadow color schemes and toolkit, icon, cursor and sound themes
 Luna Blue, Olive Green and Silver scheme definitions with matching GTK 3/4,
 labwc and Kvantum themes, the original meadow-icons, meadow-cursors and
 Meadow sound themes, and font aliases loaded by Meadow sessions only.
